/*
 * Aggregates binary operators related to char operands.
 *
 * This module groups all binary operators whose semantics involve character
 * values. Character operators are distinct from integer operators because they
 * operate on code points rather than numeric magnitudes, even though characters
 * may be represented internally as integers.
 *
 * The grouped operator families include:
 *
 *   - comparison operators (ordering and equality on character code points),
 *   - arithmetic-like operators on characters when permitted by the language
 *     (e.g., offsetting a character by an integer).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::char_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/char_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2025-01-04
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
